---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-serif font-bold mb-2">數位典藏</h1>
    <p class="text-stone-500 mb-10">整合照片、空照、衛星、3D、影片、口述歷史與 GIS 資源</p>

    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-stone-200 p-5 hover:shadow-md transition">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-3">📷</div>
        <h2 class="font-bold text-stone-800">歷史照片</h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
          1949 年戰役期間與戰後拍攝的歷史照片。含灘頭、村落、部隊與戰車等影像記錄。
        </p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-xs bg-stone-100 text-stone-500 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">建置中</span>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-stone-200 p-5 hover:shadow-md transition">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🛩️</div>
        <h2 class="font-bold text-stone-800">空照圖</h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
          1944 年美軍航照、歷年台灣農林航空測量所空照。記錄金門地貌的歷史變遷。
        </p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-xs bg-green-100 text-green-600 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">部分可用</span>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-stone-200 p-5 hover:shadow-md transition">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🛰️</div>
        <h2 class="font-bold text-stone-800">衛星圖</h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
          現代高解析衛星影像，用於今昔對比分析。展示古寧頭地區數十年來的地景變化。
        </p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-xs bg-stone-100 text-stone-500 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">建置中</span>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-stone-200 p-5 hover:shadow-md transition">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🧊</div>
        <h2 class="font-bold text-stone-800">3D 模型</h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
          戰車、碉堡、聚落建築的 3D 掃描模型。未來將整合至 Battlefield OS 互動體驗。
        </p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-xs bg-stone-100 text-stone-500 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">建置中</span>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-stone-200 p-5 hover:shadow-md transition">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🎬</div>
        <h2 class="font-bold text-stone-800">影片</h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
          紀錄片、訪談影片、戰地實景拍攝。口述歷史受訪者的第一人稱敘述。
        </p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-xs bg-stone-100 text-stone-500 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">建置中</span>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-stone-200 p-5 hover:shadow-md transition">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🎙️</div>
        <h2 class="font-bold text-stone-800">口述歷史</h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
          戰役參與者、居民、目擊者的訪談錄音與逐字稿。保存即將消逝的個人記憶。
        </p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-xs bg-stone-100 text-stone-500 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">建置中</span>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-stone-200 p-5 hover:shadow-md transition">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🗺️</div>
        <h2 class="font-bold text-stone-800">GIS 圖層</h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
          地理資訊系統圖層：戰役部署圖、部隊推進路線、防禦工事分布、今昔地圖疊加。
        </p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-xs bg-stone-100 text-stone-500 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">建置中</span>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-stone-200 p-5 hover:shadow-md transition">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-3">📜</div>
        <h2 class="font-bold text-stone-800">掃描文物</h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
          地圖、文件、證件、家書等實體文物的高解析掃描檔。可縮放檢視原始細節。
        </p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-xs bg-stone-100 text-stone-500 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">建置中</span>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-stone-200 p-5 hover:shadow-md transition">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🖼️</div>
        <h2 class="font-bold text-stone-800">今昔對比</h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
          1949 年 vs 現代照片的疊圖對比。直觀呈現地景與聚落的變遷軌跡。
        </p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-xs bg-stone-100 text-stone-500 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">建置中</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 bg-amber-50 rounded-xl border border-amber-200 p-5 text-center">
      <h3 class="font-bold text-amber-800 mb-1">徵集數位素材</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-amber-700">
        如果你持有古寧頭戰役相關的歷史照片、空照、影片或口述歷史錄音，歡迎提供數位化素材。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
